# Hotkeys continuity (Phase G3)

Use this protocol for work on DAS-compatible hotkeys and executable Nova Actions.

## Owner

`hotkeys` subagent (`.cursor/agents/hotkeys.md`).

## Start

1. Read `.cursor/agent-memory/hotkeys-memory.md`.
2. Skim `frontend/src/hotkeys/capabilityCatalog.ts` and `Nova-Roadmap-Status.md` Phase G / G2 / G3.
3. Run scoped Vitest before claiming the hotkey surface is healthy:
   `cd frontend && npx vitest run src/hotkeys src/hooks/useHotkeys.test.ts src/components/SettingsWorkspace.test.tsx`

## Hard invariants

- **Two systems:** Automation six (executor ladder) ≠ Nova Actions (manual discretionary). Do not gate System 2 on `signal`/`confirm`/`auto_paper`.
- **No raw DAS execution:** imported `.htk` Command strings never register with the dispatcher until mapped to a typed Nova Action.
- **One dispatcher:** single shell-level keydown listener; never mount a second independent `useHotkeys` that can double-fire.
- **Shortcuts menu:** menu chord (default Ctrl+M) peek / double-tap pin lives in the same dispatcher — do not add a parallel window listener.
- **Rebind on the go:** double-click a menu row → TanStack `useHotkeyRecorder` captures; conflicts via TanStack-normalized strings (`findShortcutConflict`). Do not hand-roll a second capture stack. Automation overrides persist on the hotkey profile (`automationBindings` / `shortcutsMenuKey`).
- **Key-repeat guard:** `event.repeat` must short-circuit before any callback.
- **Manual safety gates:** System 2 reuses PIN unlock, spend lock, and place-confirm preference — never bypass.
- **Bid/Ask honesty:** Ask±/Bid± actions use L2 top-of-book only; never silently substitute last trade.
- **Cancel-all is orchestration:** symbol cancel loops existing per-order `execution.service.execute(operation="cancel")` — no broker SDK bypass.
- **`auto_live` NO-GO:** never unlock live auto-trading from this domain.

## Out of scope (hand off)

- ADR 007 ledger / latency audit → `execution`
- Stock View layout / Webull montage chrome → `widgets`
- IB Gateway login / IBC → `ibkr-ops`
- Quote/L2 feed coherence → `market-feed`
- Verification → `tester`

## End of material change

1. Re-run scoped Vitest (+ `npm run build` when UI changed).
2. Update hotkeys memory Current snapshot.
3. Prepend `CHANGELOG.md` (and `PROBLEM_LOG.md` if a bug was fixed).
4. Refresh `agent-hotkeys` canvas when phase/status metrics move.
